title Where each data problem is fixed
subtitle Fixed rules run in Silver; anything learned from data runs inside the training pipeline
dir right
group silver Silver: fixed rules
group ml Pipeline: learned on train dates
bronze Bronze (cylinder) ~ The day's raw file, unchanged
dup Duplicates: keep first in silver ~ 166 exact duplicate order IDs
cat Spelling: canonical in silver ~ EXPRESS and ' standard ' become Express and Standard
bad Invalid: set missing in silver ~ Distance or value at most 0, zero items
rows Bad date/label: drop in silver ~ Row dropped and counted
gold Gold (cylinder) ~ Validated features + target
miss Missing: median in ml !accent ~ SimpleImputer fitted on training dates only
scale Scale numbers in ml ~ StandardScaler
onehot One-hot categories in ml ~ OneHotEncoder ignores unseen values
bronze -> dup !muted
bronze -> cat !muted
bronze -> bad !muted
bronze -> rows !muted
dup -> gold !muted
cat -> gold !muted
bad -> gold !muted
rows -> gold !muted
gold -> miss !muted
gold -> scale !muted
gold -> onehot !muted
